# LF in the repository and on checkout, on every platform, for the files
# whose bytes matter: template.yaml is hash-matched against the release asset
# (#7) and checked byte for byte by build_template.py --check; the handler is
# inlined into it and zipped by the Terraform route; the scripts are run
# directly (a CRLF shebang line breaks them).
template.yaml text eol=lf
template.skeleton.yaml text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
